        <mxCell id="c28" value="Purple = owned by Better Auth (server/auth.ts maps its field names to these columns).  Green = application tables.  Grey = bookkeeping.  Crow's-foot arrows point from the referencing column to the referenced key; the label is the ON DELETE rule.  Dashed = S3 object key, not a SQL reference." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
